 "meaning_fr": "attendre ; moment (时候)"}, {"char": "看", "pinyin": "kàn", "meaning_fr": "regarder"}, {"char": "电", "pinyin": "diàn", "meaning_fr": "électricité"}, {"char": "视", "pinyin": "shì", "meaning_fr": "regarder (电视 télévision)"}, {"char": "剧", "pinyin": "jù", "meaning_fr": "pièce, série (电视剧)"}, {"char": "新", "pinyin": "xīn", "meaning_fr": "nouveau"}, {"char": "虽", "pinyin": "suī", "meaning_fr": "bien que (虽然)"}, {"char": "难", "pinyin": "nán", "meaning_fr": "difficile"}, {"char": "声", "pinyin": "shēng", "meaning_fr": "son, voix ; 声调 ton"}, {"char": "调", "pinyin": "diào", "meaning_fr": "ton ; mélodie"}, {"char": "字", "pinyin": "zì", "meaning_fr": "caractère"}, {"char": "但", "pinyin": "dàn", "meaning_fr": "mais (但是)"}, {"char": "不", "pinyin": "bù", "meaning_fr": "ne… pas"}, {"char": "弃", "pinyin": "qì", "meaning_fr": "abandonner (放弃)"}, {"char": "相", "pinyin": "xiāng", "meaning_fr": "mutuellement ; 相信 croire"}, {"char": "信", "pinyin": "xìn", "meaning_fr": "croire ; lettre"}, {"char": "只", "pinyin": "zhǐ", "meaning_fr": "seulement"}, {"char": "努", "pinyin": "nǔ", "meaning_fr": "faire effort (努力)"}, {"char": "力", "pinyin": "lì", "meaning_fr": "force"}, {"char": "就", "pinyin": "jiù", "meaning_fr": "alors, tout de suite"}, {"char": "定", "pinyin": "dìng", "meaning_fr": "fixer ; 一定 sûrement"}, {"char": "谢", "pinyin": "xiè", "meaning_fr": "remercier"}]}, {"title": "谈谈你最难忘的一次旅行", "title_py": "tántan nǐ zuì nánwàng de yí cì lǚxíng", "title_fr": "Sujet 04 · Parlez de votre voyage le plus inoubliable", "sentences": [{"zh": "大家好，今天我想说说我最难忘的一次旅行。", "py": "Dàjiā hǎo, jīntiān wǒ xiǎng shuōshuo wǒ zuì nánwàng de yí cì lǚxíng.", "fr": "Bonjour à tous, aujourd'hui je voudrais parler de mon voyage le plus inoubliable."}, {"zh": "去年夏天，我和朋友去了云南。", "py": "Qùnián xiàtiān, wǒ hé péngyou qù le Yúnnán.", "fr": "L'été dernier, je suis allé au Yunnan avec un ami."}, {"zh": "我对那里的山和水很感兴趣。", "py": "Wǒ duì nàlǐ de shān hé shuǐ hěn gǎn xìngqù.", "fr": "Je m'intéresse aux montagnes et aux rivières de là-bas."}, {"zh": "我们先坐飞机，然后坐火车。", "py": "Wǒmen xiān zuò fēijī, ránhòu zuò huǒchē.", "fr": "Nous avons d'abord pris l'avion, puis le train."}, {"zh": "那里的天很蓝，空气很好。", "py": "Nàlǐ de tiān hěn lán, kōngqì hěn hǎo.", "fr": "Là-bas, le ciel est très bleu et l'air est très bon."}, {"zh": "除了看山以外，我们还去了很多老地方。", "py": "Chúle kàn shān yǐwài, wǒmen hái qù le hěn duō lǎo dìfang.", "fr": "En plus de voir les montagnes, nous sommes aussi allés dans beaucoup de lieux anciens."}, {"zh": "我们每天都吃很多好吃的菜。", "py": "Wǒmen měi tiān dōu chī hěn duō hǎochī de cài.", "fr": "Chaque jour, nous mangions beaucoup de bons plats."}, {"zh": "我们一边走，一边拍照。", "py": "Wǒmen yìbiān zǒu, yìbiān pāizhào.", "fr": "Nous prenions des photos en marchant."}, {"zh": "那里的人都很好，很热情。", "py": "Nàlǐ de rén dōu hěn hǎo, hěn rèqíng.", "fr": "Les gens là-bas étaient très gentils et très chaleureux."}, {"zh": "这次旅行既开心又难忘。", "py": "Zhè cì lǚxíng jì kāixīn yòu nánwàng.", "fr": "Ce voyage a été à la fois joyeux et inoubliable."}, {"zh": "现在我还常常想起那次旅行。", "py": "Xiànzài wǒ hái chángcháng xiǎngqǐ nà cì lǚxíng.", "fr": "Aujourd'hui, je repense encore souvent à ce voyage."}, {"zh": "以后我还想再去一次。谢谢大家！", "py": "Yǐhòu wǒ hái xiǎng zài qù yí cì. Xièxie dàjiā!", "fr": "Plus tard, j'aimerais y retourner. Merci à tous !"}], "words": [], "grammar": [], "characters": [{"char": "谈", "pinyin": "tán", "meaning_fr": "parler de, discuter"}, {"char": "你", "pinyin": "nǐ", "meaning_fr": "tu, toi"}, {"char": "最", "pinyin": "zuì", "meaning_fr": "le plus"}, {"char": "难", "pinyin": "nán", "meaning_fr": "difficile"}, {"char": "忘", "pinyin": "wàng", "meaning_fr": "oublier"}, {"char": "的", "pinyin": "de", "meaning_fr": "particule du possessif / de liaison"}, {"char": "一", "pinyin": "yī", "meaning_fr": "un"}, {"char": "次", "pinyin": "cì", "meaning_fr": "fois"}, {"char": "旅", "pinyin": "lǚ", "meaning_fr": "voyager (旅行)"}, {"char": "行", "pinyin": "xíng", "meaning_fr": "aller ; voyager (旅行)"}, {"char": "大", "pinyin": "dà", "meaning_fr": "grand"}, {"char